WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.040
Report

00:01.200 --> 00:02.840
The Wuzhao are forcing refugees to attack the city

00:02.920 --> 00:04.040
What did you say?

00:04.120 --> 00:06.453
They're forcing refugees to attack the city

00:23.120 --> 00:24.520
Hurry, come with me

00:25.120 --> 00:26.480
Faster

00:26.560 --> 00:27.120
I beg you

00:27.200 --> 00:30.200
I don't want to die, let me go back

00:34.320 --> 00:35.720
Move forward

00:36.680 --> 00:39.347
Set the ladders against the walls to survive

00:45.640 --> 00:47.160
Archers, take position

01:03.160 --> 01:03.960
This

01:04.040 --> 01:05.440
Please don't mind

01:06.280 --> 01:08.520
I am Prince of Jin Sikong Yao of Great Xuan

01:08.600 --> 01:10.000
I promise you all

01:10.680 --> 01:13.040
The royal army will surely recover our homeland

01:13.120 --> 01:14.520
And restore for everyone

01:14.600 --> 01:16.000
A peaceful world

01:24.640 --> 01:26.040
Your Highness

01:26.600 --> 01:28.560
The enemy has entered firing range
